%% Original mechanism exposition for arXiv:2608.02645v1.
%% Editable source; no paper figure copied. Explicitly separate algorithms.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Wrapper
    participant A as Synthetic API
    participant V as Read-only verifier
    W->>A: Execute action with stable key
    Note over A: Execution may commit fully, partially, later, or not at all
    alt SUCCESS response
        A-->>W: SUCCESS
        alt Literal paper mode
            Note over W: Return success immediately; no verification
        else Engineering mode
            W->>V: Check full task, including one append
            V-->>W: TRUE, FALSE, or UNKNOWN
            Note over W: Continue only within explicit retry and poll bounds
        end
    else Lost reply or timeout after commit
        A-->>W: AMBIGUOUS
        W->>V: Wait, then inspect visible state
        alt TRUE
            V-->>W: Effect verified
            Note over W: Skip retry and return success
        else FALSE
            V-->>W: Effect absent in read view
            Note over V: A stale view can produce a false negative
            alt Literal mode at N=1
                W->>A: Retry with the same key
                Note over W: Loop exhausted; final retry response uninspected
            else Engineering v2
                alt Post-retry verification poll remains
                    W->>A: Retry with the same key
                    Note over A: Server contract determines repeated effects
                    A-->>W: Inspect final retry response
                    alt Retry response is definitive FAILURE
                        Note over W: Stop immediately and return failure, no verification
                    else Retry response is SUCCESS or AMBIGUOUS
                        Note over W: Wait before verification only if AMBIGUOUS
                        W->>V: Verify full task using reserved poll
                        V-->>W: TRUE, FALSE, or UNKNOWN
                    end
                else No verification capacity remains
                    Note over W: Withhold retry; return failure
                end
            end
        else UNKNOWN
            V-->>W: Inconclusive view
            alt Literal mode at N=1
                Note over W: Continue spends the only iteration; return failure
            else Engineering mode
                W->>V: Bounded additional polling; no blind retry
            end
        end
    else Definitive FAILURE response
        A-->>W: FAILURE
        Note over W: Both modes stop; no verification or retry
    end
